    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it just feels like there's no light at the end of the tunnel though. like, no matter how much i \"breathe\" or \"take it one day at a time,\" the world is still gonna be this hostile place. it feels like i'm just fighting a losing battle against everyone else's expectations. sometimes i think it would just be easier if i didn't have to deal with any of it. if i could just... stop.",
